{"id":330,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It is nicknamed the Desert Spirit because the flapping of its wings sounds like a woman singing."},{"games":["Sword","Moon"],"text":"This Pokémon hides in the heart of sandstorms it creates and seldom appears where people can see it."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"People continue to have their hearts stolen by its enchanting songs and find themselves stranded in the desert."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"By flapping their wings, Flygon cause sandstorms that conceal Krookodile. The team then splits the prey they catch."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"The flapping of its wings sounds something like singing. Those lured by the sound are enveloped in a sandstorm, becoming Flygon’s prey."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Flygon whips up a sandstorm by flapping its wings. The wings create a series of notes that sound like singing. Because the “singing” is the only thing that can be heard in a sandstorm, this Pokémon is said to be the desert spirit."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Flygon is nicknamed “the elemental spirit of the desert.” Because its flapping wings whip up a cloud of sand, this Pokémon is always enveloped in a sandstorm while flying."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Known as “The Desert Spirit,” this Pokémon hides in the sandstorms it causes by beating its wings."},{"games":["X","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It hides itself by kicking up desert sand with its wings. Red covers shield its eyes from sand."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It whips up sandstorms with powerful flaps of its wings. It is known as “The Desert Spirit.”"},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"The flapping of its wings sounds like singing. To prevent detection by enemies, it hides itself by flapping up a cloud of desert sand."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Levitate","hidden":false,"description":"By floating in the air, the Pokémon receives full immunity to all Ground-type moves."}],"eggGroups":["Bug","Dragon"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"rough terrain","color":"Green","shape":"Wings","evolution":{"id":328,"name":"Trapinch","condition":null,"children":[{"id":329,"name":"Vibrava","condition":"Lv. 35","children":[{"id":330,"name":"Flygon","condition":"Lv. 45","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,337],[1,28],[1,48],[1,225],[1,523],[12,189],[16,328],[20,525],[24,103],[28,405],[32,201],[38,414],[44,89],[52,253],[60,407],[68,586]],"machine":[332,97,314,403,914,34,784,450,405,523,242,91,38,434,913,337,349,406,525,814,414,89,203,263,126,7,83,53,19,202,416,257,270,63,341,189,200,182,917,156,157,317,328,201,799,815,214,76,446,444,522,164,241,129,366,36,851,675,9,369,253,410],"egg":[310,44,450,242,91,349,364,660,90,175,210,16,98,276],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me2-101","name":"Flygon","set":"Phantasmal Flames","date":"2025-11-14","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"101","artist":"Ryota Murayama","img":"me2/101"},{"id":"me2-53","name":"Flygon","set":"Phantasmal Flames","date":"2025-11-14","rarity":"Rare","number":"53","artist":"Jerky","img":"me2/53"},{"id":"sv8-106","name":"Flygon ex","set":"Surging Sparks","date":"2024-11-08","rarity":"Double Rare","number":"106","artist":null,"img":"sv8/106"},{"id":"sv8-222","name":"Flygon ex","set":"Surging Sparks","date":"2024-11-08","rarity":"Ultra Rare","number":"222","artist":null,"img":"sv8/222"},{"id":"swsh9-76","name":"Flygon","set":"Brilliant Stars","date":"2022-02-25","rarity":"Rare","number":"76","artist":"Shin Nagasawa","img":"swsh9/76"},{"id":"swsh9-106","name":"Flygon V","set":"Brilliant Stars","date":"2022-02-25","rarity":"Rare Holo V","number":"106","artist":"PLANETA Mochizuki","img":"swsh9/106"},{"id":"swsh9-164","name":"Flygon V","set":"Brilliant Stars","date":"2022-02-25","rarity":"Rare Ultra","number":"164","artist":"PLANETA Mochizuki","img":"swsh9/164"},{"id":"swsh3-91","name":"Flygon